{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make vehicle odometer tampering ('clocking') a criminal offence in the UK",
        "additional_details": "Under current UK law, selling a clocked car without disclosure is illegal, but the actual act of rolling back an odometer is not. Mileage correction kits can easily be bought online for a few hundred pounds, artificially inflating vehicle values and exposing buyers to hidden safety risks. \r\n\r\nThe government has acknowledged the necessity of banning clocking as part of the Pay-Per-Mile EV tax (set for 2028), but the discussion hasn\u2019t extended to banning clocking for all vehicles, including ICE.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to update the law to:\r\nMake altering a vehicle's odometer illegal in all circumstances (for both electrified and internal combustion engine (ICE) cars).",
        "closed_at": null,
        "closing_date": "2027-04-09",
